          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">SKILL</span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Assist Max</span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\"><sup>TM</sup></span></span></p>\n",
