          "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 16 2020 18:05:24 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>SKILL Assist MAX makes collaborating, teaching and sharing cases easier and more advanced than ever. From any device, expert physicians can join your case and assist in real time, or you can stream a highly engaging learning experience for faculty and attendees.<br>\n</p>\n",
